---
args: { request: NegotiationPackageRequest; packages: ClausePackageSet; conditional: NegotiationGuardrail; evidence: EvidencePage[] }
returns: RedlineReviewSet
---
Compare each counterparty edit to the exact package wording and classify it as editorial, obligation-changing, risk-shifting or ambiguous. Bind accepted changes to an authorized issue position and preserve any conditional acceptance with its prerequisite. Recompute affected graph consequences for each material edit. Route changes beyond mandate to review rather than describing them as accepted.